config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBRETRO_MAME2003_PLUS
	bool "libretro-mame2003-plus"
	help
	  mame2003-plus built with only Nintendo's two-monitor cabinets
	  (Punch-Out!!, Super Punch-Out!!, Arm Wrestling and the Vs. dual
	  system's games), which RG DS Play shows one monitor per screen:
	  /usr/lib/libretro/mame2003_plus_libretro.so, a few megabytes rather
	  than the whole core's forty. The sets are the owner's own, in
	  /data/roms/arcade.
